  "title": "SecNode — Cookie Chain Network Intelligence",
  "shortDescription": "Real-time Cookie Chain network stats with one-click on-chain interaction.",
  "description": "SecNode is a live network intelligence dashboard for Cookie Chain. It streams real JSON-RPC data — current slot, TPS (30-sample avg), epoch, block height, and RPC latency — straight from rpc.cookiescan.io into an auto-refreshing dashboard with a live TPS chart. Its On-Chain Pulse lets anyone with a Nightly wallet send a real SPL Memo transaction to Cookie Chain and watch the full lifecycle (signing → sent → confirmed) in real time, demonstrating sub-second finality, near-zero fees, and full Solana tooling compatibility. Deployed via Cloudflare Tunnel and systemd on a VPS.",
